question_text:
Determine row_total([[9,8,7,6],[1,4,2,3]],1,0), showing every recursive call and the return calculation. Indices are zero-based.
def row_total(grid, row, col):
    if col == len(grid[row]) - 1:
        return grid[row][col]
    return grid[row][col] + row_total(grid, row, col+1)

